# Kubernetes Deployment Project

## Project Overview
This project demonstrates my ability to package, deploy, and scale application containers using Kubernetes. It showcases production-ready DevOps practices including orchestration, automated scaling, and service discovery.

## Architecture & Components
* *Containerization:* App packaged using Docker.
* *Orchestration:* Managed workloads using Kubernetes Pods, Deployments, and ReplicaSets.
* *Networking:* Exposed services externally using Kubernetes Services (ClusterIP/NodePort/LoadBalancer).

## How to Deploy Locally
1. *Start Cluster:* Run minikube start or ensure Docker Desktop Kubernetes is active.
2. *Apply Manifests:* Run kubectl apply -f ./manifests/
3. *Verify Pods:* Run kubectl get pods to ensure all services are healthy.
